### Polyclinic Generator API Examples
### Use with REST Client extension in VS Code or any HTTP client

@baseUrl = http://localhost:5001

### 1. Quick Test - Generate 10 contracts (5 per batch, no delay)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/generator?batchSize=5&payloadLimit=10&waitTime=0

### 2. Normal Load - Generate 100 contracts (10 per batch, 2s delay)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/generator?batchSize=10&payloadLimit=100&waitTime=2

### 3. Small Batch - Generate 30 contracts (3 per batch, 1s delay)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/generator?batchSize=3&payloadLimit=30&waitTime=1

### 4. Large Batch - Generate 200 contracts (50 per batch, 1s delay)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/generator?batchSize=50&payloadLimit=200&waitTime=1

### 5. Slow Continuous - Generate 50 contracts (5 per batch, 5s delay)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/generator?batchSize=5&payloadLimit=50&waitTime=5

### 6. Default Parameters - Uses defaults (10, 100, 2)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/generator

### 7. Health Check
GET {{baseUrl}}/

### 8. Swagger UI
# Open in browser: {{baseUrl}}/swagger
